            "review_by": "2027-03-01",
            "scope": "U1"
          },
          {
            "accepted_by": "pentolope",
            "because": "the debug bridge's datasheet states no negative-injection allowance for the pin at all; only a vendor figure or a bench characterisation closes it, and the series element bounds what the pin can see meanwhile",
